WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.460
So what's down there at the deepest part of the sea?

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.060
Close your eyes.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.940
Close them.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:26.000
The ocean has five layers

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:28.000
Let's go

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:36.280
The first contains all the plant life and coral reefs

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.600
Somalia is not a good idea Jay

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:40.260
I know

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:41.800
Good luck Jay

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:45.580
Whatever memory you have of submersion is there

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:46.980
in the blue water.

00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:49.660
Ok.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.200
I'm in

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:52.940
I'm in too

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:59.040
The next layer is the twilight zone

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:06.395
All of the colours and light vanish

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:10.500
and the blackness you're in now

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.820
no-one can you reach down there

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.460
I don't want death Danny

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.360
Not in this place

00:01:28.065 --> 00:01:29.435
I wanna be beside you

00:01:30.275 --> 00:01:33.285
This is the other-world

00:01:33.285 --> 00:01:34.605
in our world

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:54.460
That's not dust to dust, that's for sure

00:01:54.955 --> 00:01:56.345
That's water to water

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:06.500
I'm going to remember this

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.440
You can open your eyes

